        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thanks, I completely understand your choice of designing the API and want to make behaviors consistent. And I also agree that I can create a customize function to do the things easily.\r\n\r\nThere’s one thing I would like to request so that I do not need to copy paste a lot of the code to do the things:\r\n\r\nI just read the source code and find that `H.diff_pos_to_source` is the key function to get the file name when you are navigating a diff entry. Could you consider make it a public API so that I can get the buffer file name when the cursor is on a diff line so I can make my custom function open that file directly?",
